  "notable_quotes": [
    "Transport can be enhanced by reducing crystal size, but this improvement is penalized by lower chemical activity and thermal stability.",
    "Different synthesis or post-synthesis routes create very different mesopore geometries, which in turn can produce markedly different transport properties.",
